      producer  ge-listmode-daq/3.2 (0855f5f)
      recipe    2 config keys
    ↳ ingested_from raw.l64  [external leaf]
        source    blake3:3258a47581e9…
    ↳ derived_from blob · daq-config  [pinned]
        file      out/blake3_cce0dc5eb3dbddfa564a6480bfccdc03f021db403b27381b78a88cce1d11747c.tsra
        producer  ge-listmode-daq/3.2 (0855f5f)
        recipe    config_ref blake3:b1ab9e2dd874…
      ↳ ingested_from daq.cfg  [external leaf]
          source    blake3:b1ab9e2dd874…
      ↳ ingested_via_spec spec.toml  [external leaf]
          source    blake3:6b12472b3bd2…
    ↳ ingested_via_spec spec.toml  [external leaf]
        source    blake3:6b12472b3bd2…
  ↳ ingested_via_spec spec.toml  [external leaf]
      source    blake3:6b12472b3bd2…
  ↳ snapshot_of blob · recon-01  [pinned]
      file      out/blake3_db68ac428f07c6868dd21cd8e9e533746926a9e6e8100c8b94a3714648c11def.tsra
      producer  vig-recon/1.4 (beac041)
      recipe    3 config keys

9 hop(s) · 6 external leaf/leaves · chain complete

```

# === The same walk as a machine-readable document, for a gate that needs more than an exit code.
#     `outcome` is a stable token per hop; `complete` and `gaps` are the verdict. ===

